Q9. Implement Query-by-Data Functionality Using Riak KV

Store user JSON documents:

```bash
curl -X PUT http://localhost:8098/buckets/users/keys/U101 \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d '{"name":"Yash","age":21,"city":"Saharanpur","interest":"Technology"}'

curl -X PUT http://localhost:8098/buckets/users/keys/U102 \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d '{"name":"Rahul","age":22,"city":"Delhi","interest":"Sports"}'

